# SEO Operations (Track C)

- Source of truth: `docs/SEO_OPS_BUILD_SPEC.md` (v2). One phase at a time; do not skip acceptance criteria. Spec wrong → say so in the PR; do not silently diverge.
- **Portal extension only** — no Laravel greenfield, no separate seo-ops app. Follow `AGENTS.md` and `.cursor/rules/php-page-architecture.mdc`.
- Phasing is **content + social first** (S1 Demand engine), then findability (S2), feedback (S3), harden (S4). Phase 2 stubs for ranks/backlinks/full reports/attribution.
- **Jobs vs AI:** Function App / Python nightly jobs for GSC, GA4, Semrush REST, crawl, aggregates. AI only for briefs, drafts, social copy, claims pre-check, digests, fix specs.
- **Never** write to Adobe CMS or ad platforms. Record `published_url` only; crawler verifies.
- Every write → audit log; every external call → `api_usage`. No secrets in git. No PII to AI providers.
- Register hub/leaves in `includes/app.php` + `MODULE_PERMISSION_COLUMNS`; run `php scripts/audit-portal-nav.php` before merge.
- Branch naming: `phase/seo-s0-chassis`, `phase/seo-s1-demand`, …
